    "summary.md": "# Plant Pal\n\nA personal houseplant watering tracker that shows which plants are overdue, due soon, or fine, with a count of overdue plants at a glance.\n\n- **Target user:** Solo plant owner tracking watering on their own laptop\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** tracker\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Verified journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid plant input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete plant and see it in plants\n- plants survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing plant\n- User can search plants\n- User can narrow plants with a meaningful filter\n- plants are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing plant\n"
  },
